Package: e87n-display
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: E87N project contributors <e87n@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-pil, fonts-dejavu-core, fonts-wqy-microhei, init-system-helpers (>= 1.56)
Description: Debian-native E87N status display and diagnostics
 NV3007 framebuffer dashboard, validated backlight settings, read-only
 telemetry and the e87nctl command for the EdgePi E87N.
 The Linux thermal governor remains the sole fan controller; this package
 contains no userspace fan-control daemon, kernel module or provisioning agent.
